{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Building Hierarchies","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The relation that links a child entity to its parent."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A hierarchy groups entities into trees: a ship and its turrets, a menu and its buttons. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity has at most one parent, and despawning a parent despawns its children, and theirs in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn. Build a hierarchy with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which refuses a link that would make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an entity its own ancestor, and walk it with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/parent(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/children(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/ancestors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/descendants(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example attaches a turret and an engine to a ship, then despawns the ship,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which takes its parts with it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Turret\"))","let engine = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Engine\"))","try world.addChild(turret, to: ship)","try world.addChild(engine, to: ship)","","let parts = world.children(of: ship).map { world[Name.self, of: $0].value }","print(parts)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Turret\", \"Engine\"]\"","","world.despawn(ship)","print(world.contains(engine))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ChildOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" like any other, so an entity with a parent holds a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Targets<ChildOf>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" component naming it. Queries use that to find the entities at each level"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of a tree:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".related(ChildOf.self, to: parent)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" keeps the children of ","type":"text"},{"code":"parent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".with(Targets<ChildOf>.self)"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps entities that have a parent."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".without(Targets<ChildOf>.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" keeps the roots.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let menu = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Menu\"))","let play = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Play\"))","let quit = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Quit\"))","try world.addChild(play, to: menu)","try world.addChild(quit, to: menu)","","print(world.query(Name.self).related(ChildOf.self, to: menu).count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","print(world.query(Name.self).without(Targets<ChildOf>.self).count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"metadata":{"title":"ChildOf","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Hierarchy.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Hierarchy.swift#L51"},"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule7ChildOfV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/init()","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/isExclusive","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/onTargetDespawn"],"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf\/Equatable-Implementations",